+<div class="container">
+  <h2>Application Overview</h2>
+  <p>GenApp is a 3-tier CICS application modeling a general insurance system. It supports four policy types processed through a presentation → business logic → data management chain, with dual persistence (DB2 primary + VSAM secondary).</p>
+
+  <h2>Policy Types</h2>
+  <table>
+    <tr><th>Code</th><th>Type</th><th>DB2 Table</th><th>COMMAREA Redefine</th><th>Full Length</th></tr>
+    <tr><td><strong>E</strong></td><td>Endowment</td><td>ENDOWMENT</td><td>CA-ENDOWMENT</td><td>124 bytes</td></tr>
+    <tr><td><strong>H</strong></td><td>House</td><td>HOUSE</td><td>CA-HOUSE</td><td>130 bytes</td></tr>
+    <tr><td><strong>M</strong></td><td>Motor</td><td>MOTOR</td><td>CA-MOTOR</td><td>137 bytes</td></tr>
+    <tr><td><strong>C</strong></td><td>Commercial</td><td>COMMERCIAL</td><td>CA-COMMERCIAL</td><td>1174 bytes</td></tr>
+  </table>
