+    <div class="card"><a href="lgipol01.html"><span class="badge badge-bl">BL</span><h3>LGIPOL01</h3><p>Inquire Policy — validates COMMAREA, links to LGIPDB01</p></a></div>
+    <div class="card"><a href="lgupol01.html"><span class="badge badge-bl">BL</span><h3>LGUPOL01</h3><p>Update Policy — validates type + length, links to LGUPDB01</p></a></div>
+    <div class="card"><a href="lgdpol01.html"><span class="badge badge-bl">BL</span><h3>LGDPOL01</h3><p>Delete Policy — validates request ID, links to LGDPDB01</p></a></div>
+  </div>
+
+  <h3>🟢 DB2 Data Management Layer</h3>
+  <div class="grid">
+    <div class="card"><a href="lgapdb01.html"><span class="badge badge-db2">DB2</span><h3>LGAPDB01</h3><p>Add Policy DB2 — INSERT to POLICY + type table, links to LGAPVS01</p></a></div>
+    <div class="card"><a href="lgipdb01.html"><span class="badge badge-db2">DB2</span><h3>LGIPDB01</h3><p>Inquire Policy DB2 — SELECT with 7 variants, cursor support</p></a></div>
+    <div class="card"><a href="lgupdb01.html"><span class="badge badge-db2">DB2</span><h3>LGUPDB01</h3><p>Update Policy DB2 — UPDATE POLICY + type table</p></a></div>
+    <div class="card"><a href="lgdpdb01.html"><span class="badge badge-db2">DB2</span><h3>LGDPDB01</h3><p>Delete Policy DB2 — DELETE from POLICY + type table</p></a></div>
+  </div>
+
+  <h3>🟠 VSAM Data Management Layer</h3>
+  <div class="grid">
+    <div class="card"><a href="lgapvs01.html"><span class="badge badge-vsam">VSAM</span><h3>LGAPVS01</h3><p>Add Policy VSAM — writes 64-byte summary to KSDSPOLY</p></a></div>
+    <div class="card"><span class="badge badge-vsam">VSAM</span><h3>LGIPVS01</h3><p>Inquire Policy VSAM — reads summary from KSDSPOLY</p></div>
+    <div class="card"><span class="badge badge-vsam">VSAM</span><h3>LGUPVS01</h3><p>Update Policy VSAM — rewrite summary in KSDSPOLY</p></div>
+    <div class="card"><span class="badge badge-vsam">VSAM</span><h3>LGDPVS01</h3><p>Delete Policy VSAM — delete record from KSDSPOLY</p></div>
+  </div>
+
+  <h3>🟣 Utilities</h3>
