+    <div class="card"><a href="lgstsq.html"><span class="badge badge-util">UTIL</span><h3>LGSTSQ</h3><p>Error writer — GENAERRS TSQ + CSMT TDQ. Called by ALL programs.</p></a></div>
+    <div class="card"><span class="badge badge-util">UTIL</span><h3>LGASTAT1</h3><p>Customer statistics collector — aggregates policy counts per customer</p></div>
+  </div>
+</div>
+<footer>Generated by IBM Bob Premium Package for Z &bull; GenApp Application Knowledge Base &bull; 2025</footer>
