          "score": 0.79418087,
          "content": "Before changing anything, switch to Bob's **Ask mode**. Click the mode selector drop-down to the left of the chat input field and select **Ask**, or type `/ask` in the chat.\n\n![Mode selector dropdown showing Ask mode selection](/images/bob-quickstart-ask.png)\n\nAsk mode can only read files, not write them. Bob can't change anything in this mode, so it's safe to explore. [Modes](/docs/ide/features/modes) are one way Bob respects the principle of least privilege.\n\nAsk Bob to explain the project:\n\n```text\nExplain what this application does and how it works.\n```\n\nBob reads through the project and explains what it does.",
