          "score": 14.654784,
          "content": "Before modernizing, click the mode selector dropdown and switch to Bob's **Ask mode**. Ask mode can only read files, so you can safely explore code without accidentally making changes. You can also type `/ask` in Bob chat to change to Ask mode.",
